PIN selected-region independent references
* Modified: 2026-11-22
* Skyworks 200313B Figure 8: PN DC branch and frozen-bias RF equivalent.
* Implementation checks, not measured PIN noise validation.
.temp 27
.options reltol=1e-11 abstol=1e-16 gmin=1e-20
.model pn D(IS=1e-8 N=2.2 RS=1.48)
Ib0 0 a0 DC 0.0001
Vpin0 a0 j0 .08
Dpn0 j0 0 pn
Ib1 0 a1 DC 0.001
Vpin1 a1 j1 .08
Dpn1 j1 0 pn
Ib2 0 a2 DC 0.01
Vpin2 a2 j2 .08
Dpn2 j2 0 pn
Ib3 0 a3 DC 0.05
Vpin3 a3 j3 .08
Dpn3 j3 0 pn
Vcal ci 0 DC 0 AC 1
Rcal ci co 50
Gcal co 0 co 0 .02
Voff ao 0 -5
Roff ao jo 4e6
Doff jo 0 pn

